OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and windy, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain affecting the region
OL,7,Ffor much of the day before clearing in
OL,8,Fthe northwest during the early
OL,9,Fevening. Winds will gradually ease
OL,10,Flater in the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe cloud and rain will
OL,13,Fslowly move southeastwards overnight
OL,14,Fbecoming heavy at times. With clear
OL,15,Fskies developing behind and across the
OL,16,Fregion by dawn, allowing temperatures
OL,17,Fto readily fall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
